    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42756" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρυθρῖνος</span></b> , also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρυθῖνος</span></b>  (q.v.), ὁ, a
